85
00:05:57,580 --> 00:06:02,540
And when I got there, there was kind of actually less need for a logistician.

86
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:09,980
So after kind of kicking it around a little bit, I ended up somehow put in charge of the

87
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:15,420
Medevac program and in Lviv.

88
00:06:15,420 --> 00:06:21,900
