89
00:06:21,900 --> 00:06:24,900
Awesome.

90
00:06:24,900 --> 00:06:31,900
And just to give some context, GRM is a nonprofit called Global Response Management and they

91
00:06:31,900 --> 00:06:38,620
do disaster response and humanitarian work around the world.

92
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:41,900
And Jason, how'd you end up over there?

93
00:06:41,900 --> 00:06:47,860
Well I'm lucky enough to have a job where I work for a little bit and then I'm off for

94
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:48,980
a little bit.

95
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:56,780
And it just so happened to be that one of my little bit of times off was in May, June

96
00:06:56,780 --> 00:07:01,660
and July of I guess that's still this year, 2022.

97
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:08,320
So I was looking for a way to volunteer in Ukraine and I believe I saw it on LinkedIn.

98
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:12,920
