ambulance, they don't have to necessarily help you.

211
00:14:27,460 --> 00:14:32,860
So whatever you whatever you have might be what you need to get you to all

212
00:14:32,860 --> 00:14:33,900
the way where you're going.

213
00:14:33,980 --> 00:14:38,940
And, you know, we definitely heard stories about other ambulances running

214
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:42,780
really sick patients and they have having issues and having to pull to another

215
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:44,580
hospital. But luckily they were in another country.

216
00:14:44,580 --> 00:14:46,740
I think they were in Belgium at the time.

217
00:14:46,740 --> 00:14:49,420
So it was a it was an interesting situation.

218
00:14:50,140 --> 00:14:51,660
I think I over answered your question there.

219
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:52,340
So I'm sorry.

